{
  "$comment": "The half of the template metadata that cannot be computed. Counts, complexity and section totals are derived from the corpus by templates/tools/metadata.mjs and deliberately NOT stored here — this project has twice found hand-maintained numbers that had gone stale against the data they described, and a stored form_fields_count is that failure waiting to happen. What is here is judgement: how long something takes to think through, what to suggest next, which format it should leave in, and how often it needs re-reading. Estimated time in particular has to be authored, because the spec's own table gives the Invoice and the LLC Operating Agreement fifteen fields each and three-to-five versus fifteen-to-twenty-five minutes — a five-fold difference that no function of field count can produce.",
